    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kube is a 2D platformer where you'll have to think in 3D. Your perspective will change, but remember: gravity always pushes downward! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, and swim around a multitude of cubes. Meet creatures, avoid traps and solve puzzles in this game where each world you visit introduces fresh new mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JUMP IN 2D, THINK IN 3D</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/8fa94dc0091ea908cbaf4ec9118d1c36.poster.avif?t=1728632563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/8fa94dc0091ea908cbaf4ec9118d1c36.webm?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/8fa94dc0091ea908cbaf4ec9118d1c36.mp4?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Unlike your classic 2D-platformer game, KUBE has a unique twist where you'll move around cube-shaped worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will turn your perspective around at every corner, and will require you to think in 3D in order to find your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SCRATCH YOUR HEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/959b919aac2377f18fd9d91f9bb28c72.poster.avif?t=1728632563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/959b919aac2377f18fd9d91f9bb28c72.webm?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/959b919aac2377f18fd9d91f9bb28c72.mp4?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You'll solve mind-bending puzzles during your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of them may look simple, but who knows how you'll fare with these weird new laws of gravity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EACH PLANET BRINGS SOMETHING NEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/0412088a7242c2ac41c44eb9d726bb99.poster.avif?t=1728632563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/0412088a7242c2ac41c44eb9d726bb99.webm?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/0412088a7242c2ac41c44eb9d726bb99.mp4?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Explore this huge new universe full of mysteries and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are more than 10 different planets to travel through; each of those comes with a gorgeous setting as well as unique game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn more about this world by taking part in a one-of-a-kind adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EMBARK ON AN EPIC JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient menace threaten to destroy the whole universe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you're just a small service robot who woke up by accident, what could you do to prevent any of this?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND ALL THE SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving the universe may be fun and all, but collecting everything and finding all the secrets that this game has to offer will prove to be a real challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you up to the task?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music in the video:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel Good by MusicbyAden </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creative Commons \u2014 Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported \u2014 CC BY-SA 3.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free Download / Stream: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music promoted by Audio Library</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kube is a 2D platformer where you'll have to think in 3D. Your perspective will change, but remember: gravity always pushes downward! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, and swim around a multitude of cubes. Meet creatures, avoid traps and solve puzzles in this game where each world you visit introduces fresh new mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JUMP IN 2D, THINK IN 3D</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/8fa94dc0091ea908cbaf4ec9118d1c36.poster.avif?t=1728632563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/8fa94dc0091ea908cbaf4ec9118d1c36.webm?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/8fa94dc0091ea908cbaf4ec9118d1c36.mp4?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Unlike your classic 2D-platformer game, KUBE has a unique twist where you'll move around cube-shaped worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will turn your perspective around at every corner, and will require you to think in 3D in order to find your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SCRATCH YOUR HEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/959b919aac2377f18fd9d91f9bb28c72.poster.avif?t=1728632563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/959b919aac2377f18fd9d91f9bb28c72.webm?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/959b919aac2377f18fd9d91f9bb28c72.mp4?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You'll solve mind-bending puzzles during your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of them may look simple, but who knows how you'll fare with these weird new laws of gravity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EACH PLANET BRINGS SOMETHING NEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/0412088a7242c2ac41c44eb9d726bb99.poster.avif?t=1728632563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/0412088a7242c2ac41c44eb9d726bb99.webm?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820860/extras/0412088a7242c2ac41c44eb9d726bb99.mp4?t=1728632563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Explore this huge new universe full of mysteries and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are more than 10 different planets to travel through; each of those comes with a gorgeous setting as well as unique game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn more about this world by taking part in a one-of-a-kind adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EMBARK ON AN EPIC JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient menace threaten to destroy the whole universe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you're just a small service robot who woke up by accident, what could you do to prevent any of this?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND ALL THE SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving the universe may be fun and all, but collecting everything and finding all the secrets that this game has to offer will prove to be a real challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you up to the task?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music in the video:</p>